{{!< default}}
{{!-- The TFR rail, first on the page and pinned under the masthead as on the reader (Ian, 2026-09-23). --}}
{{> "faith-received/_tfr-rail"}}
{{#contentFor "moHead"}}
<title>Disputed questions | The Faith Received | Mere Orthodoxy</title>
<meta name="description" content="The classic disputed questions of theology, with every place the library treats them and each author's answer." />
<link rel=preconnect href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel=preconnect href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel=stylesheet href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Source+Serif+Pro:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap">
<style>
.tfr-tool{--bg:#FFFFFF;--fg:#1C1C1A;--muted:#5A5A56;--border:#D8D8D3;--card-bg:#FFFFFF;--highlight:#EFEFEA;
  --font-display:'EB Garamond',Georgia,serif;--font-body:'Source Serif Pro',Georgia,serif;--sans:'Source Serif Pro',Georgia,serif;}
/* THE ATLAS OF DISPUTED QUESTIONS (2026-10-20). 2026-10-21: each answer is one row, the same as on the maps of the tradition: who
   (name, dates and tradition) | his answer, and the work it stands in | the pages, at the right; an answer group shows six rows and
   folds the rest, unless the tally narrows to it. One type scale: secondary .8rem, body 1rem, headings 1.25 / 1.6 / 2rem. */
.tfr-tool *{box-sizing:border-box}
.tfr-tool{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:16px/1.62 var(--font-body);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
.tfr-tool a{color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool :is(a,button,summary,input):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--fg);outline-offset:2px}
.tfr-tool .wrap{max-width:64rem;margin:0 auto;padding:1.8rem 1.2rem 4rem}
.tfr-tool h1{font:500 2rem/1.2 var(--font-display);margin:.2rem 0 .6rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .lede{max-width:68ch;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 1.4rem;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .ct{color:var(--muted);font:400 .8rem/1.3 var(--sans);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .sr{position:absolute;left:-9999px}
.tfr-tool .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(14rem,19rem) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.8rem;align-items:start}
.tfr-tool .loci{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .loci details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .loci summary{cursor:pointer;padding:.55rem .2rem;font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display);list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.5rem}
.tfr-tool .loci summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tfr-tool .loci summary small{color:var(--muted);font:.8rem/1.3 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .loci ul{list-style:none;margin:0 0 .6rem;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .loci li button{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:.4rem .3rem .4rem .8rem;border:0;background:none;color:var(--fg);font:1rem/1.35 var(--font-body);cursor:pointer;border-radius:4px;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .loci li button:hover{background:var(--highlight)}
.tfr-tool .loci li button[aria-current="true"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
.tfr-tool .q h2{font:500 1.6rem/1.25 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .3rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem;margin:0 0 .3rem}
.tfr-tool .note{margin:0 0 .4rem;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);font-style:italic}
.tfr-tool .tally{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin:.6rem 0 1.2rem}
.tfr-tool .tally button{border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);padding:.35rem .75rem;border-radius:3px;font:600 .8rem/1.2 var(--sans);cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .tally button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg);border-color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .tally button[aria-pressed="true"] .ct{color:inherit}
.tfr-tool .ans{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.45rem;margin:1.6rem 0 0;padding-bottom:.35rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--fg);font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .hl{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .hr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(7.5rem,12rem) minmax(0,1fr) minmax(3.2rem,auto);gap:.1rem 1.2rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.55rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .hr[hidden]{display:none}
.tfr-tool .h-who{font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display);text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .h-who small{display:block;margin-top:.1rem;color:var(--muted);font:400 .8rem/1.35 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .h-line{max-width:68ch;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .h-src{display:block;margin-top:.15rem;color:var(--muted);font:italic .8rem/1.4 var(--font-body)}
.tfr-tool .h-pg{text-align:right;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.5;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .h-pg .pp{display:block;white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .more{margin:.45rem 0 0;padding:.3rem .7rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);font:600 .8rem/1.2 var(--sans);cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .more:hover{border-color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .muted{color:var(--muted)}
@media (max-width:760px){.tfr-tool .cols{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
.tfr-tool .loci{max-height:min(50vh,22rem);overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}}
@media (max-width:640px){.tfr-tool .wrap{padding:1.2rem 1rem 3rem}
.tfr-tool h1{font-size:1.6rem}
.tfr-tool .q h2{font-size:1.25rem}
.tfr-tool .hr{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;grid-template-areas:"who pg" "line line";column-gap:.8rem}
.tfr-tool .h-who{grid-area:who}
.tfr-tool .h-pg{grid-area:pg}
.tfr-tool .h-line{grid-area:line;margin-top:.2rem}}
.tfr-tool{background:transparent}
.tfr-tool .wrap{padding-top:1.2rem}
/* THE PAGE PREVIEW (2026-10-22, owner: "make it easy to preview things in the controversies, indices, etc"): a page reference's
   Preview opens the page itself under its row, in the page window (page-window.js; its look is work-hub.css). The same block on the
   controversies, the maps, the atlas, the shared questions and the set indexes. Here the cited page is named in its head rather than
   marked by a stripe, every page reads at full strength, the passage is marked in a tint of the ink, and Both stacks the two texts
   when the column is narrow (a side's preview sits in its side). */
.tfr-tool .pgs{display:inline-flex;flex:none;align-items:baseline;white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .pvb{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;margin-left:.45rem;padding:.1rem .55rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);font:600 .8rem/1.2 var(--sans,var(--font-body));text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .pvb:hover{border-color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .pvb[aria-expanded="true"]{background:var(--fg);border-color:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
.tfr-tool a.pvl[aria-expanded="true"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg);text-decoration:none;border-radius:2px;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .pvb:focus-visible,.tfr-tool .pvl:focus-visible,.tfr-tool .pvw :is(a,button):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--fg);outline-offset:2px}
@media (pointer:coarse){.tfr-tool .pvb::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-.55rem -.2rem}}
.tfr-tool .pvw{grid-column:1/-1;flex:1 0 100%;margin:.6rem 0 .8rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;background:var(--card-bg);overflow:hidden;container-type:inline-size;text-align:left;white-space:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:1rem;--accent:var(--fg);--accent-soft:color-mix(in srgb,var(--fg) 20%,var(--card-bg));--body:var(--font-body)}
.tfr-tool .pvw-head{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:.1rem 1rem;padding:.2rem .75rem;background:var(--bg);font:.8rem/1.3 var(--font-body)}
.tfr-tool .pvw-at{margin-right:auto;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .pvw-head a,.tfr-tool .pvw-x{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:2rem;padding:0;border:0;background:none;color:var(--fg);font:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .pvw-pp{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.25rem}
@container (max-width:30rem){.tfr-tool .pvw-pp{order:3;flex-basis:100%;padding-bottom:.3rem}}
.tfr-tool .pvw-pp button{min-width:2rem;min-height:1.75rem;padding:0 .45rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);font:inherit;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .pvw-pp button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--fg);border-color:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-page h4{display:block;margin:0 0 6px;padding:0;border:0;font:600 .8rem/1.3 var(--body);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-col h5{margin:.4em 0 .6em;padding:0;border:0;font:600 1rem/1.4 var(--body);text-align:center;text-wrap:balance;color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-col p{margin:0 0 .7em;max-width:70ch;font:1rem/1.65 var(--body);color:var(--fg);white-space:pre-line}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-col p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-col .pw-none{color:var(--muted);font-style:italic;font-size:.8rem}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-cited{border-left:0;padding-left:0;margin-left:0}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-page:not(.pw-cited){opacity:1}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-wait a{color:var(--fg)}
@container (max-width:36rem){.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-two{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:.8rem}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.tfr-tool .pvw{animation:pvw-in .18s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}}
@keyframes pvw-in{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-3px)}}
</style>
{{/contentFor}}
{{!-- /the-faith-received/disputed-questions/: Disputed questions, as The Faith Received has it (tools/prdl_reader_prototype/atlas.html), in this site's
     shell: the hero is the theme's, the body and its script (faith-atlas.js) the library's, reading the library worker. --}}
<section class="bhero bhero--tool">
  <div class="bhero-inner container">
    <p class="bhero-kicker"><a href="/the-faith-received/">The Faith Received</a> <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span> Disputed questions</p>
    <h1 class="bhero-title">The classic disputed questions</h1>
    <p class="bhero-lede">The questions the schools and the confessions argued, from whether God's existence can be demonstrated to whether the saints are to be invoked. Each lists the authors in the library who answer it, what each answers in his own terms, and the pages where he says it.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="{{asset "js/page/faith-tfr-rail.js"}}" defer></script>
<main class="tfr-tool"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="cols"><nav aria-label="Questions by locus"><div class="loci" id="loci"><p class="muted">Loading…</p></div></nav><article class="q" id="q" aria-live="polite"></article></div>

</div></main>
